  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are suave and disarming with humanoids of all kinds.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Natural Charmer<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can expend a use of mythic power to use this feat as a standard action rather than taking 20 times as long as normal. Your caster level when using charm effects against humanoids is increased by 1, and you can expend a mythic surge to increase the save DC of any charm effect used against a humanoid by an amount equal to one-half the result of the surge die (minimum 1).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
